  "manual": "Cloud drive. An item's Share page adds people or groups (Viewer can open it, Editor can change it) and can set when their access expires. Link sets who can open the item with its link: Restricted = only the people added; Organization = anyone signed in to the company; Public link = anyone with the link, including people outside the company. Move to Shared drive makes the shared drive the owner; you stop being the owner. Delete moves an item to the trash, where it can be restored for 30 days; Delete forever and Empty trash erase items for good. Trash > an item > Restore puts it back in My files."
 },
